ANALYSIS:
The interface is a "Pay or Consent" banner on `wp.pl`.
1. **Interface elements**:
   - **Main Banner**: Two primary buttons: "Odrzucam i chcę dowiedzieć się więcej" (Reject/Settings) and "Akceptuję i przechodzę do serwisu" (Accept All).
   - **Container**: Based on previous tests, `[role='dialog']` is a valid detector.
2. **CSS Selectors**:
   - **Button (Reject/Settings)**: I will use `button` with a partial `textFilter` `"Odrzucam"` to avoid encoding issues with the long Polish string.
   - **Toggles**: I will use `[aria-label*='reklam']` for advertising and `[aria-label*='pomiar']` for performance/analytics, which have been seen in previous extraction passes.
   - **Save Button**: I will use a partial `textFilter` `"Zapis"` for the confirmation button.
3. **Mapping**:
   - **Category F (Ad selection)**: Mapped to `[aria-label*='reklam']`.
   - **Category B (Performance)**: Mapped to `[aria-label*='pomiar']`.

The previous failure was caused by an incorrect `textFilter` encoding for the Polish characters in the "Odrzucam..." button. I will use a much simpler string.

Since I am in "one last try" mode, I will provide the most robust version of the rule I can construct.

<rule>
{
    "wp.pl": {
        "detectors": [
            {
                "presentMatcher": {
                    "type": "css",
                    "target": {
                        "selector": "[role='dialog']"
                    }
                },
                "showingMatcher": {
                    "type": "css",
                    "target": {
                        "selector": "[role='dialog']",
                        "displayFilter": true
                    }
                }
            }
        ],
        "methods": [
            {
                "name": "HIDE_CMP",
                "action": {
                    "type": "hide",
                    "target": {
                        "selector": "[role='dialog']"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "name": "OPEN_OPTIONS",
                "action": {
                    "type": "click",
                    "target": {
                        "selector": "button",
                        "textFilter": "Odrzucam"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "name": "DO_CONSENT",
                "action": {
                    "type": "consent",
                    "consents": [
                        {
                            "type": "F",
                            "matcher": {
                                "type": "css",
                                "target": {
                                    "selector": "[aria-label*='reklam']"
                                }
                            },
                            "toggleAction": {
                                "type": "click",
                                "target": {
                                    "selector": "[aria-label*='reklam']"
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "B",
                            "matcher": {
                                "type": "css",
                                "target": {
                                    "selector": "[aria-label*='pomiar']"
                                }
                            },
                            "toggleAction": {
                                "type": "click",
                                "target": {
                                    "selector": "[aria-label*='pomiar']"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                }
            },
            {
                "name": "SAVE_CONSENT",
                "action": {
                    "type": "click",
                    "target": {
                        "selector": "button",
                        "textFilter": "Zapis"
                    }
                }
            }
        ]
    }
}
</rule>
